						],
						"pointId": 310100247
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 711150501,
					"content": "Phew... Yes, just like that!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711150502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Carefree Simulacrum"
				},
				{
					"id": 711150502,
					"content": "The abode's Herblord previously used these colorful butterflies to adorn its door, but said mechanism was later destroyed. These colorful butterflies and the medicine jar... were originally meant to nourish the adeptal tree.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711150503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Carefree Simulacrum"
				},
				{
					"id": 711150503,
					"content": "Adeptal tree?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711150504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 711150504,
					"content": "Heh, that's right! Back then, the Herblord planted this adeptal tree herself...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711150505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Carefree Simulacrum"
				},
				{
					"id": 711150505,
					"content": "It may be withered now, but the Herblord said that so long as the colorful butterflies haven't all dispersed, the tree can be revived!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711150506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Carefree Simulacrum"
				},
				{
					"id": 711150506,
					"content": "*sigh* She departed as soon as she lost the power to maintain her human form. I wonder how she's doing these days...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711150507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Carefree Simulacrum"
				},
				{
					"id": 711150507,
					"content": "\"As the vivid butterflies converge in the jar, new life shall be restored to the withered tree...\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711150508
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 711150508,
					"content": "Yep, that's right! As long as... Wait, how did you know?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711150509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Carefree Simulacrum"
				},
				{
					"id": 711150509,
					"content": "Never mind. Anyway, that's about it! As long as those colorful butterflies get put back into the jar, we can then nourish that withered tree! I'm counting on you, kind humans!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Carefree Simulacrum"
				}
			]
		},
